<title>HONG KONG: Buildmore year net loss HK$1.05 mln.</title>
<headline>Buildmore year net loss HK$1.05 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended January 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.46 loss vs 1.96 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1.05 loss vs 1.41 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Company name		 Buildmore International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Buildmore International is an investment holding company which specialises in property investment and development.</p>
<p>The group was prevented from disposing Lisboa Garden since July 18, 1995 as a result of the injunction order as previously reported. No turnover was recorded by the group for the year under review.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
